---
const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'Why did you build Beberes?',
    a: 'On an 8GB RAM / 256GB SSD MacBook Air, running out of disk space cripples system performance because macOS cannot allocate swap space. Most commercial cleaners ignore developer directories (like node_modules and simulator caches) or cost expensive annual subscriptions. Beberes was built to solve this natively and transparently in Rust.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Will Beberes ever delete my source code or Git commit history?',
    a: 'No. The project hibernation engine strictly targets expendable build artifacts (such as node_modules, target, .venv, .next, .dart_tool). It explicitly refuses to touch .git repositories, source code files, or anything outside the selected project boundary.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How does the default "Move to Trash" mode work?',
    a: 'By default, Beberes moves files to the native macOS Trash via AppleScript/Finder. This means anything cleaned can be restored from the Trash if needed. You can toggle direct permanent deletion in the top bar if you need to reclaim disk space immediately on a full SSD.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Is Beberes native to Apple Silicon?',
    a: 'Yes. Beberes is compiled as a native universal macOS application with full support for Apple Silicon (M1, M2, M3, M4 series) and Intel Macs running macOS 11.0 (Big Sur) or newer.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How do I update Beberes when a new version is released?',
    a: 'Beberes includes an in-app update checker in Settings that notifies you whenever a new release is available on GitHub. You can also re-download the latest DMG directly from this website.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Is there any telemetry or background tracking?',
    a: 'Zero. Beberes has no analytics SDKs, no user tracking, and no external telemetry. All disk inspection and operations run entirely offline on your Mac.',
  },
];
---

<section class="py-20 border-t border-zinc-200/80 bg-white dark:border-zinc-800/80 dark:bg-zinc-950">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">FAQ</span>
      <h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-950 sm:text-4xl dark:text-white">
        Frequently Asked Questions
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 space-y-6">
      {faqs.map((faq) => (
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-200/80 bg-zinc-50/50 p-6 dark:border-zinc-800/80 dark:bg-zinc-900/40">
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">{faq.q}</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">{faq.a}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
